; Called by LinuxCNC on every abort (ESC, E-stop, program error)
; via [RS274NGC]ON_ABORT_COMMAND in the INI.
;
; SAFETY: release the automatic drawbar-open request (M64 P1 from rack_change.ngc).
; M64 outputs are NOT reset by an abort. If P1 stays high, the drawbar opens again
; by itself after every later M5 / spindle stop.
o<on_abort> sub
M65 P#<_ini[ATC_PINS]ATC_OPEN>
o<on_abort> endsub
M2
